      "match_notes": "<p>Great&nbsp;win&nbsp;for&nbsp;hawarden&nbsp;park&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;game&nbsp;played&nbsp;in&nbsp;amazing&nbsp;spirit.&nbsp;Tom&nbsp;wilson&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;game&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;excellent&nbsp;43&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;very&nbsp;tough&nbsp;period&nbsp;for&nbsp;hawarden.&nbsp;Then&nbsp;the&nbsp;reliable&nbsp;uncle&nbsp;albert&nbsp;(nick&nbsp;woods)&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;amazing&nbsp;spell&nbsp;taking&nbsp;4&nbsp;for&nbsp;14&nbsp;off&nbsp;8&nbsp;overs&nbsp;including&nbsp;triple&nbsp;wicket&nbsp;maiden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Gresford&nbsp;bowled&nbsp;really&nbsp;well&nbsp;in&nbsp;some&nbsp;tough&nbsp;batting&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;sam&nbsp;burke&nbsp;taking&nbsp;4&nbsp;for&nbsp;16&nbsp;and&nbsp;harry&nbsp;morris&nbsp;taking&nbsp;1&nbsp;for&nbsp;12&nbsp;had&nbsp;hawarden&nbsp;30&nbsp;for&nbsp;5&nbsp;after&nbsp;16&nbsp;overs&nbsp;freddie&nbsp;clegg&nbsp;jess&nbsp;jones&nbsp;james&nbsp;thomas&nbsp;and&nbsp;owain&nbsp;walker&nbsp;the&nbsp;other&nbsp;4&nbsp;bowlers&nbsp;keeping&nbsp;it&nbsp;really&nbsp;tight&nbsp;and&nbsp;taking&nbsp;wickets</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Owen&nbsp;ford&nbsp;was&nbsp;also&nbsp;really&nbsp;unlucky&nbsp;with&nbsp;4&nbsp;dropped&nbsp;catches&nbsp;off&nbsp;his&nbsp;bowling&nbsp;really&nbsp;unlucky&nbsp;not&nbsp;to&nbsp;have&nbsp;got&nbsp;5&nbsp;wickets&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
